{"last_link_id": 61, "nodes": [{"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "text_conditioning", "links": [52], "label": "text_conditioning", "type": "WOOSH_TEXT_COND", "localized_name": "text_conditioning"}], "size": [320, 70], "pos": [-1122.455322265625, 694.2532348632812], "widgets_values": ["T2A — text to audio (Flow/DFlow)"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "mode"}, "name": "mode", "label": "mode", "type": "COMBO", "localized_name": "mode"}], "flags": {}, "id": 41, "type": "WooshTextEncode", "properties": {"ver": "a2523c2d689aff3b0f2e24fa293acc020a08c357", "ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.2"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {"mode": true}, "aux_id": "Saganaki22/ComfyUI-Woosh", "Node name for S&R": "WooshTextEncode"}, "order": 0}, {"outputs": [], "color": "#c09430", "widgets_values": ["# Woosh — 音效生成工具\n通过索尼 AI 的 Woosh 基础模型，根据文本描述或视频生成音效。\n\n---\n\n## 模型列表\n\n| 模型 | 任务 | 显存占用 | 步数 | CFG |\n|------|------|----------|------|-----|\n| Woosh-Flow | 文本转音频 | 约 8–12GB | 50 | 4.5 |\n| Woosh-DFlow | 文本转音频（精简版） | 约 4–6GB | 4 | 1.0 |\n| Woosh-VFlow | 视频转音频 | 约 8–12GB | 50 | 4.5 |\n| Woosh-DVFlow | 视频转音频（精简版） | 约 4–6GB | 4 | 1.0 |\n\n---\n\n## 手动下载\n从 [drbaph/Woosh](sslocal://flow/file_open?url=https%3A%2F%2Fhuggingface.co%2Fdrbaph%2FWoosh&flow_extra=eyJsaW5rX3R5cGUiOiJjb2RlX2ludGVycHJldGVyIn0=) 下载模型，并放置到 `ComfyUI/models/woosh/` 目录下：\n\n```\n📂 ComfyUI/\n├── 📂 models/\n│   └── 📂 woosh/\n│       ├── 📂 Woosh-Flow/   （文本转音频基础模型）\n│       │      ├── config.yaml\n│       │      └── weights.safetensors\n│       ├── 📂 Woosh-DFlow/  （文本转音频精简模型）\n│       │      ├── config.yaml\n│       │      └── weights.safetensors\n│       ├── 📂 Woosh-VFlow-8s/  （视频转音频基础模型）\n│       │      ├── config.yaml\n│       │      └── weights.safetensors\n│       ├── 📂 Woosh-DVFlow-8s/  （视频转音频精简模型）\n│       │      ├── config.yaml\n│       │      └── weights.safetensors\n│       ├── 📂 Woosh-AE/ ⚠️ 必需组件\n│       │      ├── config.yaml\n│       │      └── weights.safetensors\n│       ├── 📂 TextConditionerA/ ⚠️ 必需组件\n│       │      ├── config.yaml\n│       │      └── weights.safetensors\n│       └── 📂 TextConditionerV/ ⚠️ 必需组件\n│              ├── config.yaml\n│              └── weights.safetensors\n```\n\n> **Woosh-AE、TextConditionerA 和 TextConditionerV 为必需组件** — 所有生成模型都会在内部加载它们。\n\n---\n\n## 节点说明\n\n### Woosh Model Loader\n加载生成模型 — 选择模型文件夹与模型类型（Flow/DFlow/VFlow/DVFlow）。已内置 Woosh 库，无需额外 pip 安装。\n\n### Woosh Sampler\n根据文本或视频输入生成音频。输出 `video_frames`（仅视频转音频可用）和 `audio`。将 `video_frames` 接入 VideoCombine 可预览带音频的视频。\n\n### Woosh Video Loader\n从文件路径加载视频，或接收图片序列作为视频输入。\n\n### Woosh TextConditioning\n加载外部 CLAP 文本编码器。模式设置为 **T2A** 用于 Flow/DFlow，**V2A** 用于 VFlow/DVFlow。\n\n---\n\n## 采样参数\n\n| 参数 | 默认值 | 取值范围 | 说明 |\n|------|--------|----------|------|\n| prompt | \"\" | — | 音效的文本描述 |\n| steps | 50 | 4–100 | 采样步数。Flow 用 50，DFlow 用 4 |\n| cfg | 4.5 | 0–10 | 无分类器引导强度。Flow/VFlow 用 4.5，DFlow/DVFlow 用 1.0 |\n| seed | 0 | — | 随机种子（0 为每次随机） |\n| latent_frames | 501 | 100–2000 | 音频时长（100 帧 ≈ 1 秒，48kHz） |\n| force_offload | False | — | 运行后将模型从 GPU 与 CPU 内存中完全卸载 |\n\n---\n\n## 使用技巧\n\n- 若可接受画质，使用 DFlow/DVFlow 以 4 步快速生成\n- 开启 `force_offload` 可在运行间隙释放显存\n- TextConditioning 模式需与模型匹配：**T2A** 用于文本转音频，**V2A** 用于视频转音频\n- 安装 [ComfyUI-VideoHelperSuite](sslocal://flow/file_open?url=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2FKosinkadink%2FComfyUI-VideoHelperSuite&flow_extra=eyJsaW5rX3R5cGUiOiJjb2RlX2ludGVycHJldGVyIn0=) 以使用 VideoCombine 节点预览视频+音频输出\n- 首次运行会从 HuggingFace 下载 RoBERTa 分词器，之后会本地缓存\n\n---\n\n## 相关链接\n\n- 模型地址 [drbaph/Woosh](sslocal://flow/file_open?url=https%3A%2F%2Fhuggingface.co%2Fdrbaph%2FWoosh&flow_extra=eyJsaW5rX3R5cGUiOiJjb2RlX2ludGVycHJldGVyIn0=)\n- 论文 [arXiv:2502.07359](sslocal://flow/file_open?url=https%3A%2F%2Farxiv.org%2Fabs%2F2502.07359&flow_extra=eyJsaW5rX3R5cGUiOiJjb2RlX2ludGVycHJldGVyIn0=)\n- 官方原版 [SonyResearch/Woosh](sslocal://flow/file_open?url=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2FSonyResearch%2FWoosh&flow_extra=eyJsaW5rX3R5cGUiOiJjb2RlX2ludGVycHJldGVyIn0=)\n- 节点插件 [ComfyUI-Woosh](sslocal://flow/file_open?url=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2FSaganaki22%2FComfyUI-Woosh&flow_extra=eyJsaW5rX3R5cGUiOiJjb2RlX2ludGVycHJldGVyIn0=)\n- 问题反馈 [Report Bug](sslocal://flow/file_open?url=https%3A%2F%2Fgithub.com%2FSaganaki22%2FComfyUI-Woosh%2Fissues&flow_extra=eyJsaW5rX3R5cGUiOiJjb2RlX2ludGVycHJldGVyIn0=)"], "inputs": [], "flags": {}, "type": "MarkdownNote", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "rgba(24,24,27,.9)", "size": [510, 1410], "pos": [-2325.132080078125, 395.8370361328125], "id": 44, "properties": {"ue_properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "input_ue_unconnectable": {}, "version": "7.5.2"}, "widget_ue_connectable": {}}, "order": 1}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "STRING", "links": [56], "label": "STRING", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "字符串"}], "size": [402.67449951171875, 112.79489135742188], "pos": [-1686.0052490234375, 803.2984619140625], "widgets_values": ["下雨"], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "label": "value", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "值"}], "flags": {}, "id": 47, "type": "PrimitiveStringMultiline", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "PrimitiveStringMultiline"}, "order": 2}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "int", "links": [58], "label": "整数", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "int"}], "size": [270, 58], "pos": [-1634.3428955078125, 1103.5234375], "widgets_values": [3], "inputs": [{"widget": {"name": "value"}, "name": "value", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "值"}], "flags": {}, "id": 50, "type": "easy int", "properties": {"widget_ue_connectable": {}, "Node name for S&R": "easy int"}, "order": 3}, {"mode": 0, "outputs": [{"name": "INT", "links": [59, 60], "label": "整数", "type": "INT", "localized_name": "整数"}, {"name": "FLOAT", "label": "浮点", "type": "FLOAT", "localized_name": "浮点"}], "size": [270, 98], "pos": [-1186.3848876953125, 1095.773681640625], "widgets_values": ["a*100+1"], "inputs": [{"shape": 7, "name": "a", "link": 58, "type": "*", "localized_name": "A"}, {"sh